.TH FILEFORGE-DISCOVER 1 "FileForge 2.0"
.SH NAME
fileforge-discover \- scan system for FileForge aliases and instances
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fileforge-discover
.RB [ --root " DIR" ]
.RB [ --verbose ]
.RB [ --json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
fileforge-discover scans the filesystem for FileForge-related binaries,
wrappers, symlinks, and configuration files. It normalizes paths and
reports all discovered instances.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --root " DIR"
Root directory to start scanning from. Defaults to current directory.
.TP
.BR --verbose
Print detailed information about each discovered instance.
.TP
.BR --json
Output results as JSON.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B fileforge-discover --root ~/file-forge --verbose
.br
Scan the ~/file-forge directory with verbose output.
